  unitName: Death God Shida
  unitId: 60095
  unitNumber: 714
  description: A sorcerer from the Bariura Empire who could command all magical spells.
    During the end of the great war with the gods, he disappeared along with his
    extensive research facility. Records left behind state that afterwards, when
    the Imperial Army had been surrounded by the God Army, a being that resembled
    Shida appeared on the battlefield and destroyed all the enemies present in an
    instant. However, testimony from a knight who witnessed it all says that Shida
    murmured "I have found the materials I need for my new research. I shall be on
    my way." and then disappeared into the darkness.
  summonDesc: Since I had nothing to study, I left.<br>Did I need any other reason?<br>We
    could've shared the results.
  fusionDesc: It still has an effect on me<br>in this form. Heh heh heh.<br>I never
    get tired of Fusion...
  evoDesc: This form is the result<br>of my research.<br>You wouldn't understand.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
